sequenceDiagram
    actor User as User browser
    participant SPA as V4 SPA<br/>(app.v4.referwell.com)
    participant Auth0 as Auth0<br/>(auth0.v4.referwell.com)
    participant Google as IDP (Google, Entra, etc)
    participant API as V4 API<br/>(api.v4.referwell.com)
    autonumber

    User->>SPA: Open application
    SPA->>Auth0: Universal Login (corporate email)
    Auth0->>Google: Redirect to an IDP
    User->>Google: IDP password + 2-Step Verification<br><i>(Omitted when a IDP session already exists)</i>
    Google-->>Auth0: Authenticated identity returned
    Note over Auth0: Group allowed? (Post-login Action)
    Auth0-->>User: 6a. Deny — no token issued
    Auth0->>SPA: Redirect + JWT to SPA callback
    SPA->>API: API call with Bearer JWT
    Note over API: Check iss, aud, sig
    API-->>SPA: Resource, or HTTP 401
